      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEELING DUSTY (1) ran on strongly fresh at Bendigo to grab third with the big weight, getting within a long neck of a well-ridden winner. He should be better for that run second up and to 1600m now looks ideal. Very hard to hold out. MOUNT SABYINYO (2) improved second up at Geelong behind a handy one in Bella Verona, beaten under a length. Fitter again and maps ideally up on speed to a mile which looks suitable. WOUNDER (6) is racing very consistently in Queensland, now comes to the Perdon yard (ex Chris Waller). She creates interest, market best guide. OVERPRICED (3) is coming off a win at Warrnambool and has each way claims. BELCONY (5) brings the Bella Verona form and is in the mix.",
